{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/DescentGif1.gif?t=1749740869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descent is a first-person survival horror game in which you play as an employee of a highly confidential organization that specializes in research and extraction of rare minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unexpected incident occurs at a research station and an evacuation alarm is triggered. As you run for the nearest exit, the ceiling collapses and everything goes dark. You wake up exhausted, drenched in blood and without a single living soul nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape the facility, you will first need to touch the gates of hell buried deep underneath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/DescentGif2.gif?t=1749740869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Research Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden deep within Oregon\u2019s dense forests, far from any signs of human civilization, it\u2019s the perfect place for conducting unethical research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What lurks in the depths...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The horrors you will stumble upon have been resting for a long time. To overcome them, be smart, gather resources, keep moving, and listen to your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/DescentGif3.gif?t=1749740869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro Style 90s Horror Filter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the dark and twisted story of the research station through notes left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look for healing items to restore your health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new paths or interact with the environment using collected items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outrun the enemies: you can't fight back - use the environment to escape or hide from approaching death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801660?t=1749740869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801660?t=1749740869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/b835fc70bc2483e4663f88a530c10495053f100f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749740869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/b835fc70bc2483e4663f88a530c10495053f100f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749740869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content. The Game may also trigger seizures in certain viewers due to exposure to flashing lights or other flashing light patterns."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img cl